  "title": "Build context-aware agents using GitHub Copilot, Elastic, and Azure AI",
  "description": "Your AI reviewer has amnesia; it knows your code, but forgets the 2 AM outage from last month. We’ll demo giving Copilot a memory. Using Elastic Agent Builder and Workflows, we build an agent that reviews PRs against production telemetry and incident history. See it in action: an agent identifies a regression pattern, cites a past incident via OTel traces in Elasticsearch, and helps a dev fix it in VS Code via Copilot Agent Mode and the Elastic MCP server. Powered by Azure AI Foundry.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
